Review: gpt-6-astra, codex 0.155.1, read-only sandbox, 2026-09-29; verdict REJECT; log
`docs/PLAN-V3-review.log`. Each finding addressed below; § references are to this revision.

1. **Major — training time underestimated (1.942, not 2.373 presentations/s).** FIXED: §5.1
   uses the corrected throughput (1.942), max_minutes 570→**1320**, and defines
   incomplete-epoch disposition (no partial-epoch shipping).
