3. **Major — G-D and IFEval instruments unidentified; n≥50 scope unclear.** FIXED: §8.9 names
   `v2/candidates/arcspan-train-sample.jsonl` (500-row arcspan candidate sample, sha256
   36812f5a0897352d75c6155c3f99100866e240518fd9a0065fad5ffa7ab43d4a; gate on the first 100 rows
   in file order, deterministic and receipted) for G-D, and
   `v2/data/probe-set-gG-ifeval.jsonl` (40 rows, sha256
   ac07a3a40c50efe6cb590c23d9055cc83a7067eb066f5901826a1a425fc00678) for IFEval (retained floor
   explicitly 40). The n≥50 floor is scoped to exactly the §8.9 fresh instruments with variable
